# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# The four loghub seeds are committed on purpose (see seeds/NOTICE.md) — the
# blanket `*.log` above would otherwise swallow them too.
!/seeds/*.log

# The generated corpus, and the gzipped copies `upload-logs.mjs` sends to R2.
# Both disposable, and outside `public/` so a build cannot copy them into dist/.
.logs
.logs-gz

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
